---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<section id="my-passion" class="passion-band" aria-labelledby="passion-heading">
  <div class="wrap passion-content">
    <div class="passion-heading"><h2 id="passion-heading">My Passion<span>Where it all started.</span></h2><p>From a father’s track.<br/>To a lifelong dream.</p></div>
    <figure class="passion-film">
      <video controls playsinline preload="none" width="1280" height="720" poster="/images/club-ranch-memories-wide-poster.jpg" aria-label="My Passion — Club Ranch MX film">
        <source src="/videos/club-ranch-memories-wide.mp4" type="video/mp4"/>
        Your browser does not support this video. <a href="/videos/club-ranch-memories-wide.mp4">Watch the film.</a>
      </video>
      <figcaption><span>Jordan Jackson’s story</span><a href="/videos/club-ranch-memories-wide.mp4" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open video <Icon name="external"/></a></figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div class="passion-story">
      <div class="story-heading">
        <h3>A life built<br/>around the ride.</h3>

      </div>
      <div class="story-body">
      <div class="story-copy"><p>For Jordan Jackson, motocross has always been more than a sport. It started on a dirtbike track his father designed and built — a place where growing up meant being close to the dirt, the bikes, and the people who loved to ride. At Jackson’s MX track, professional riders from across America came to train and ride. That was the world Jordan grew up in.</p>
      <p>Jordan went on to become a professional motocross rider himself. Later, business and family needed to come first, but the love of riding never left him.</p>
      <p>Now, owning and running his own MX track in Colorado is a dream come true. Club Ranch MX carries that passion forward: the chance to build something meaningful, bring riders together, and share the feeling that started it all on his father’s track.</p></div>
        <div class="story-photos" aria-label="Photos from Jordan’s story">
          <a class="story-photo" href="/images/jordanmx1.jpg" aria-label="Enlarge photo of Jordan on bike 449 beside a fellow rider" aria-haspopup="dialog"><img src="/images/jordanmx1.jpg" width="1440" height="1440" alt="Jordan seated on bike 449 beside a fellow rider at the track" loading="lazy"/></a>
          <a class="story-photo" href="/images/jordan-story-track.jpeg" aria-label="Enlarge photo of Jordan riding bike 449 at the track" aria-haspopup="dialog"><img src="/images/jordan-story-track.jpeg" width="1170" height="1753" alt="Jordan riding bike 449 with two people watching beside the track" loading="lazy"/></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .passion-band { background:var(--paper); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); margin-bottom:40px; }
  .passion-content { padding-block:32px 64px; }
  .passion-heading { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:end; gap:32px; margin-bottom:32px; }
  h2 { font-size:clamp(52px,6vw,80px); }
  h2 span { display:block; font-size:.52em; color:var(--emphasis); margin-top:12px; }
  .passion-heading>p { font-family:var(--display); font-size:26px; line-height:1.2; }
  video { display:block; width:100%; height:auto; aspect-ratio:16 / 9; object-fit:contain; background:#06131c; border-radius:16px; box-shadow:var(--photo-shadow); }
  figcaption { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; gap:16px; margin-top:16px; font-size:12px; color:var(--muted); }
  figcaption a { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; color:var(--ink); text-decoration:underline; }
  .passion-story { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:28px; margin-top:40px; }
  .story-heading { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; gap:24px; }
  .story-body { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.2fr) minmax(0,1fr); gap:36px; align-items:stretch; }
  .story-photos { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:12px; min-height:0; }
  .story-photo { display:block; position:relative; min-width:0; min-height:0; border-radius:12px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:var(--photo-shadow); cursor:zoom-in; }
  .story-photo img { position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; }
  .story-photo:last-child img { object-position:center 65%; }
  .story-photo:hover { outline:2px solid var(--emphasis); outline-offset:3px; }
  h3 { font-size:clamp(36px,4vw,52px); }
  .passion-story p { font-size:16px; max-width:65ch; }
  .passion-story p+p { margin-top:20px; }
  @media(max-width:760px) {
    .passion-band { margin-bottom:24px; }
    .passion-content { padding-block:20px 40px; }
    .passion-heading { display:block; margin-bottom:24px; }
    .passion-heading>p { font-size:22px; margin-top:20px; }
    .passion-story { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:20px; margin-top:28px; }
    .story-heading { gap:12px; align-items:flex-start; }
    .story-heading h3 { font-size:32px; }
    .story-body { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:24px; }
    .story-photos { gap:12px; }
    .story-photo { aspect-ratio:3 / 4; }
    .passion-story p { font-size:14px; }
  }
</style>
